        "original_id": "a44393ee-0ca0-5268-90e7-74c6a77f3b51",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Mary Shelley's Frankenstein, Animal House, Amadeus, The Hunchback of Notre Dame\n- People: Kenneth Branagh, Robert De Niro, Tom Hulce, Helena Bonham Carter, Ian Holm, John Cleese, Aidan Quinn, Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart\n- Roles: Director, actor, Quasimodo, Larry \"Pinto\" Kroger\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Hulce is best known for playing Larry \"Pinto\" Kroger in the 1978 film Animal House.\n- Tom Hulce received an Academy Award nomination for portraying Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart in the 1984 film Amadeus.\n- Mary Shelley's Frankenstein is a 1994 horror drama film directed by Kenneth Branagh.\n- Mary Shelley's Frankenstein stars Robert De Niro, Kenneth Branagh, Tom Hulce, Helena Bonham Carter, Ian Holm, John Cleese, and Aidan Quinn.\n- Tom Hulce played Quasimodo in Disney's 1996 film The Hunchback of Notre Dame.",
